WEBVTT

00:01.040 --> 00:03.000
Father Emperor is about to gain a truly loyal and righteous servant.

00:02.760 --> 00:10.400
The kind of "loyal servant" who points straight at my nose and curses me?! You truly think your old man has lived too long!

00:10.800 --> 00:13.500
Your son is terrified!
Enough!

00:15.840 --> 00:27.000
I have read his pathetic verse. A sanctimonious pedant—as if only he has a mouth, as if only he cares for the people! Living off my imperial salary, yet cursing heaven and earth—and daring to curse me!
